%U A126490 55086325175168,372549608975494,2519764601804580,17043643041857548
%N A126490 Number of base 22 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by three or less.
%C A126490 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+7^(n-1) for base>=3n-2; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+7^(n-1)-2 when base=3n-3
%H A126490 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126490 <a href="/index/Rec#order_10">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (12,-31,-54,146,134,-106,-68,18,5,-1).
%o A126490 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>3)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>3))
%Y A126490 Cf. Base 22 differing by two or less A126409, one or less A126376.
%K A126490 nonn,base,changed
%O A126490 0,2
